I walk up the stairs to my apartment.
In the hallway I meet my neighbor, Nina.
She smiles and says hi.
"Hi Nina, do you want to drink coffee on Friday afternoon?" I ask.
Nina smiles back, but she shakes her head a little.
"I am rarely home on Fridays," she explains.
"But do you have time on Saturday?"
I nod happily.
"Yes, Saturday is a really good day," I answer.
"Super, should we say three o'clock?" Nina asks.
"Three o'clock is perfect," I say.
We say goodbye, and I go into my apartment.
I am very much looking forward to the weekend.
